          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your return policy and process?",
            "text": "<p>You can request a return or exchange up to 30 days after your order was placed. All returns must be unwashed, unworn and undamaged. They’re intimates after all 😉</p><p><a href=\"https://negative-underwear.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Click here to start a return &gt;</strong></a><br/><br/>We offer free exchanges and returns to store credit. For refunds to your original payment, we have a $5 restocking fee to help support the many people in our supply chain. You’ll spot this deducted from the balance of your refund once we’ve received and clicked \"good to go!\" on your return.</p><p>Please note,</p><p>     - All price reduced SALE items are Final Sale or exchange only, as denoted on the product page. Items purchased (unworn, with tags, in original packaging) are eligible to return for credit or exchange only within 30 days of placing your order.</p><p>     - Exchanges, store credits and/or refunds will be issued only after returned goods have been received and inspected by our warehouse to confirm they meet our return-eligible criteria above.</p><p>- Store credit requests are free to process and issued electronically; credits do not expire and can be used toward anything on our site.</p><p>- Please allow up to 5 business days to receive and process your return request after your return package has been shipped.</p><p>- While we try our best, direct exchange requests are not guaranteed because our stock is limited.</p><p>- If you’re returning part of a Pack, the refunded amount will reflect the item’s Pack price, not the standard full price of the item.</p><p>- If you’re returning an item purchased with a discount code, your refund will reflect the item’s proportionally discounted price, not the standard full price of the item.</p><p>- Damaged returns and returns sent back without prior authorization will be returned to sender.</p><p>- Digital gift cards are non-refundable.</p><p>- No printer? No problem. You can now return via QR code at all eligible USPS QR locations.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
